cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BeltMap, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "BeltMap: Conveyor-belt map reconstruction and particle localization tools"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Pfaff
    given-names: Florian
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-05-07"
abstract: >-
  BeltMap provides Python tools for reconstructing conveyor-belt background maps,
  estimating belt phase, rendering clean belt backgrounds, normalizing residual
  images, detecting particles, and estimating particle velocities relative to belt
  motion.
keywords:
  - conveyor belt
  - particle localization
  - particle tracking
  - background subtraction
  - image registration
  - computer vision
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/IPS-Stuttgart/BeltMap"
url: "https://github.com/IPS-Stuttgart/BeltMap"
